llenhall\ncommunity and the broader Midlands region, CACMOR promotes youth\nempowerment, cultural expression, and meaningful dialogue.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-457a3ae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"457a3ae\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33e3831 elementor-widget elementor-widget-soundsphere_core_section_title\" data-id=\"33e3831\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"soundsphere_core_section_title.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"qodef-shortcode qodef-m  qodef-section-title qodef-alignment--left  \">\n\t\t<h6 class=\"qodef-m-title\" >\n\t\t\t\t\tWorking and Professional Skills\t\t\t<\/h6>\n\t\t<p class=\"qodef-m-text\" style=\"margin-top: 12px\">The radio\nplatform is one of our ways of amplifying unheard voices, inspiring creativity,\nand building bridges across generations through music, stories, and everyday\nexperiences<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78492a4 e-con-full qodef-elementor-content-grid e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"78492a4\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c93c695 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6c93c695\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6442995b elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"6442995b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c1bc172 e-con-full e-